<title>USA: Freddie Mac upsizes REMIC series 1920, 1928.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac upsizes REMIC series 1920, 1928.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp (Freddie Mac or FHLMC) said Monday it upsized two Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities.</p>
<p>FEMIC series 1920, underwritten by Smith Barney, was increased by $200 million of 30-year, 7.5 percent single-family fixed-rate mortgages for a total new size of $600 million.</p>
<p>Series 1928, underwritten by Goldman Sachs, was increased by $110 million of 30-year, 7.5 percent single-family fixed-rate mortgages, for a total new size of $610 million.</p>
</text>
